          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fall at least 10 feet and land on a solid surface.</p><hr /><p>You slam into the ground, shattering it around you. Treat the fall as 10 feet shorter. You land on your feet. The ground in a @Template[emanation|distance:5] becomes difficult terrain. Any creature in the emanation when you land takes @Damage[5[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage] damage as the debris hits it and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the start of its next turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 10
          },
          "prerequisites": {
